{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午10時許，香港仔石排灣道100A號發生工業意外。</p><p>現場為香港仔漁業及海事分署，警方接報有吊臂撞及建築物外牆，兩男女受傷，其中男子一度昏迷。</p><p>救援人員到場，62歲男傷者回復知覺，半昏迷送往瑪麗醫院，57歲女傷者清醒同送院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.324755+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:03:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.558017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.324755+00:00","content_hash":"5c1bde28c709298d2886f0e3ff05606b10b3cedefeca55e474af9ee12a893719","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}